Save93 / Whiterun exterior / joined Papyrus BSJobs batches and native FIFO / 2026-11-09

Setup and method
- Skyrim AE 1.6.1170.0, exact copied Save93 ESS/co-save, same disposable profile. SSE Display Tweaks 0.5.16 enabled, 42 FPS gameplay cap, dynamic Papyrus budget. Frame generation off only in the disposable profile. Four Bannered Mare to WhiterunWorld returns, with 32 Utility.Wait(0.01) probes per return.
- Live disassembly confirms that AE IDs 39074 and 39075 collect script tasklets through the original VM vtable slot 0x12, then submit and wait on the same stock JobList. Call sites are gameplay 0x6D2D54/0x6D2D5C and menu 0x6D2E2C/0x6D2E34. The wait wrapper (69353) calls the stock join (69377). The join checks the final signal count, increments the list generation to retire the old job list, waits for participants to sign off, and performs the original reset.
- Capture the actual JobListLocal address and stock tasklet membership before submission, then run the stock submit and wait as-is. Validate generation advancement, zero signed-up threads and the stock joined flag after wait. Match completed GetWorldSpace tasklets to the actual submitted list using exact tasklet identity and time bounds. Compare the FIFO head's exact query identity and DynDOLOD root-lock owner under the original queue guard. Record the rendered frame, thread, ownership of frozenStacksLock and original native drain context. No VM scheduling, object lock or queue membership is changed by this mode.
- FIFO ordering readback compares the observed head stack at join to the actual first next stock pop, and counts the intervening messages in the servicing drain. For exact heads that fail the freeze-guard requirement, reconstruct the root lock release for the same stack and token from the observation trace.
- APBGameplayTrace built and the runtime call-site verification passed. Synthetic checks covered wrong job-list identity, wrong membership count, tasklet/query identity, FIFO mismatch, missing VM guard and frame advance. Budget policy checks passed.
- Raw capture build/gameplay-trace/cell-42-getworldspace-batch-observe. DLL SHA256 77763DE909AAE84A8D33C6A90BB523FD553FE12F04CEBBC3036577F4179E6FE9.

